<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates up at end-Nov.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates up at end-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa beans in store in Europe as of the end of November/early December. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		    Total	     Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p> AMSTERDAM	415,000	   38,510</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN  98,750	   15,512</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)  42,500	    4,083</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	 12,800	    9,429</p>
<p> ANTWERP	   78,940	    2,434</p>
<p>The data gives the following changes to month-ago levels -</p>
<p> AMSTERDAM	 UP   5,000</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN  UP   1,250</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)  UP     750</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	 DOWN    50</p>
<p> ANTWERP	   UP   3,440</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
